## Project Overview

**Title:** Universal Vote-by-Mail: Replication and Extension of Thompson et al. (2020)

**Objective:** Replicate and extend the finding that universal vote-by-mail has no partisan effects and modestly increases turnout.

**Result:** Original findings CONFIRMED through 2024.

